# Shareworks Defect-to-Fix Automation Plan

**Goal:** Automate the flow *Splunk logs → defect identification → root cause in the Shareworks monolith → proposed fix*, built as GitHub Copilot custom agents, skills, and instructions modeled on assets in [github/awesome-copilot](https://github.com/github/awesome-copilot).

**Ground rules (from our discussion):**

- Platform: **GitHub Copilot** (VS Code agent mode, Copilot CLI, and later the Copilot coding agent on github.com)
- Codebase: **Java monolith** (Shareworks)
- Autonomy: **Human-in-the-loop** — the agent investigates and drafts; an engineer approves before any PR
- Trigger: **On-demand first**, scheduled/alert-driven automation in a later phase

