## 5. End-to-End Flow (Phase 1, on-demand)

1. Engineer (in VS Code or Copilot CLI): `@sw-splunk-triage what's spiking in prod since yesterday's release?`
2. Agent runs playbook SPL, returns 3 deduped Defect Dossiers ranked by impact
3. Engineer picks one: `@sw-root-cause take dossier #2`
4. Agent returns RCA report: `VestingCalculator.java:412`, introduced in commit `abc123` (last Tuesday's PR #4521), NPE when a grant has a null cliff date — 96 % confidence, evidence chain attached
5. Engineer: `@sw-fix-engineer fix it`
6. Agent writes failing test, minimal null-guard fix, runs tests, self-reviews → presents diff for approval
7. Engineer approves → draft PR with RCA report in the description; Jira ticket linked

